# The launcher's value fields (Monitor, Resolution, Language, Brightness and
# the DirectDraw choice) are Windows STATIC controls. Dump them as drawn, after
# hovering Play (which repaints the form under them), and after the Language
# right arrow has changed one.
wait 6000
dump fields
move 584 450
wait 700
move 300 540
wait 700
dump hover
click left 427 441
wait 700
dump language
wait 300
